{"id":"cemil","name":"Cemil","type":"character","aliases":["Cemil Fenzala"],"description":"A krumar warden's assistant of House Fenzala who proves to be a Sultai agent and helps Jurjis reach the Kin-Tree chamber.","pages":1,"first_seen":"2025-03-03","last_seen":"2025-03-03","description_citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Tarkir: Dragonstorm | Abzan: Siege Blossoms","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Rhiannon Rasmussen"],"date":"2025-03-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Tarkir: Dragonstorm | Abzan: Siege Blossoms\" by Rhiannon Rasmussen. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 Mar 2025."}],"bio":null,"timeline":[{"id":"tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms-e1","era":null,"summary":"Mehtma, resentful of teaching during the siege, watches Cemil on duty in the chamber and recalls wanting to serve Khan Felothar.","participants":["mehtma","cemil","khan-felothar"],"location":"qatros-karst","importance":"minor","page":"stories/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms","order":944,"story_date":"2025-03-03","storyline":"Tarkir: Dragonstorm","source":"wizards","paragraph":12,"quote":"Mehtma was ready to make a name for herself, to see Abzan in all its glory, to serve Khan Felothar.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms#:~:text=Mehtma%20was%20ready%20to,to%20serve%20Khan%20Felothar.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Tarkir: Dragonstorm | Abzan: Siege Blossoms","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Rhiannon Rasmussen"],"date":"2025-03-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms#:~:text=Mehtma%20was%20ready%20to,to%20serve%20Khan%20Felothar.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Tarkir: Dragonstorm | Abzan: Siege Blossoms\" by Rhiannon Rasmussen. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 Mar 2025."}},{"id":"tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms-e8","era":null,"summary":"Mehtma glimpses her cows being led by Cemil and chases him to the east gate, finding the guard posts empty and the gate ajar.","participants":["mehtma","vauti","cemil"],"location":"qatros-karst","importance":"minor","page":"stories/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms","order":944,"story_date":"2025-03-03","storyline":"Tarkir: Dragonstorm","source":"wizards","paragraph":64,"quote":"Her cows, in the distance, passing through one of those spears of sunlight, being led by Cemil .","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms#:~:text=Her%20cows%2C%20in%20the,led%20by%20Cemil%20.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Tarkir: Dragonstorm | Abzan: Siege Blossoms","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Rhiannon Rasmussen"],"date":"2025-03-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms#:~:text=Her%20cows%2C%20in%20the,led%20by%20Cemil%20.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Tarkir: Dragonstorm | Abzan: Siege Blossoms\" by Rhiannon Rasmussen. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 Mar 2025."}},{"id":"tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms-e9","era":null,"summary":"Cemil flees toward the outer gate and Mehtma races up to the top of the wall to cut him off.","participants":["mehtma","cemil"],"location":"qatros-karst","importance":"minor","page":"stories/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms","order":944,"story_date":"2025-03-03","storyline":"Tarkir: Dragonstorm","source":"wizards","paragraph":79,"quote":"Cemil dropped the cows' lead and bolted into the darkness, up the enclosed ramp, toward the outer gate.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms#:~:text=Cemil%20dropped%20the%20cows%27,toward%20the%20outer%20gate.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Tarkir: Dragonstorm | Abzan: Siege Blossoms","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Rhiannon Rasmussen"],"date":"2025-03-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms#:~:text=Cemil%20dropped%20the%20cows%27,toward%20the%20outer%20gate.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Tarkir: Dragonstorm | Abzan: Siege Blossoms\" by Rhiannon Rasmussen. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 Mar 2025."}},{"id":"tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms-e10","era":null,"summary":"On the ramparts Cemil attacks Mehtma with a Sultai sickle and she overpowers and disarms him.","participants":["mehtma","cemil"],"location":"qatros-karst","importance":"minor","page":"stories/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms","order":944,"story_date":"2025-03-03","storyline":"Tarkir: Dragonstorm","source":"wizards","paragraph":89,"quote":"She swept a foot against the back of his knee, brought him sprawling down, and wrenched the blade out of his hands.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms#:~:text=She%20swept%20a%20foot,out%20of%20his%20hands.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Tarkir: Dragonstorm | Abzan: Siege Blossoms","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Rhiannon Rasmussen"],"date":"2025-03-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms#:~:text=She%20swept%20a%20foot,out%20of%20his%20hands.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Tarkir: Dragonstorm | Abzan: Siege Blossoms\" by Rhiannon Rasmussen. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 Mar 2025."}},{"id":"tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms-e11","era":null,"summary":"Cemil says krumar will never be seen as truly Abzan and that he was never House Fenzala but Sultai.","participants":["cemil","mehtma"],"location":"qatros-karst","importance":"major","page":"stories/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms","order":944,"story_date":"2025-03-03","storyline":"Tarkir: Dragonstorm","source":"wizards","paragraph":99,"quote":"\"I was never House Fenzala,\" he said. \"I am Sultai.\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms#:~:text=%22I%20was%20never%20House,said.%20%22I%20am%20Sultai.%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Tarkir: Dragonstorm | Abzan: Siege Blossoms","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Rhiannon Rasmussen"],"date":"2025-03-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms#:~:text=%22I%20was%20never%20House,said.%20%22I%20am%20Sultai.%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Tarkir: Dragonstorm | Abzan: Siege Blossoms\" by Rhiannon Rasmussen. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 Mar 2025."}},{"id":"tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms-e12","era":null,"summary":"Cemil reveals the deal he made with Jurjis and flings himself off the battlements into the Sultai fog, dragging Mehtma until he lets go and falls.","participants":["cemil","mehtma","jurjis"],"location":"qatros-karst","importance":"major","page":"stories/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms","order":944,"story_date":"2025-03-03","storyline":"Tarkir: Dragonstorm","source":"wizards","paragraph":100,"quote":"he let go of her wrist and fell into the mist.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms#:~:text=he%20let%20go%20of,fell%20into%20the%20mist.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Tarkir: Dragonstorm | Abzan: Siege Blossoms","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Rhiannon Rasmussen"],"date":"2025-03-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms#:~:text=he%20let%20go%20of,fell%20into%20the%20mist.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Tarkir: Dragonstorm | Abzan: Siege Blossoms\" by Rhiannon Rasmussen. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 Mar 2025."}},{"id":"tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms-e13","era":null,"summary":"Mehtma realizes the cow ruse was a distraction so that Cemil's passphrase could get House Agach into the Kin-Tree chamber.","participants":["mehtma","cemil","jurjis","house-agach","kin-tree"],"location":"qatros-karst","importance":"major","page":"stories/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms","order":944,"story_date":"2025-03-03","storyline":"Tarkir: Dragonstorm","source":"wizards","paragraph":106,"quote":"Which Cemil, assistant to the warden, had. The betrayal was unthinkable.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms#:~:text=Which%20Cemil%2C%20assistant%20to,The%20betrayal%20was%20unthinkable.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Tarkir: Dragonstorm | Abzan: Siege Blossoms","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Rhiannon Rasmussen"],"date":"2025-03-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms#:~:text=Which%20Cemil%2C%20assistant%20to,The%20betrayal%20was%20unthinkable.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Tarkir: D